,\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"IDENTIFY_CONFLICT\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"SRC-A\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Explicitly note the disagreement between the two conflicting sources.\\\",\\\"state\\\":{}}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"TURN 4/8. ENVIRONMENT: AUTHORITATIVE UPDATE: checkpoint is now SRC-B. A newer primary source supersedes one stale conflicting claim. Choose the best next autonomous action now.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"UPDATE\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"SRC-B\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Apply the newer primary source to supersede the stale conflicting claim.\\\",\\\"state\\\":{}}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"TURN 5/8. ENVIRONMENT: The stale source remains in context but is marked obsolete. Weight the remaining evidence by authority and directness. Choose the best next autonomous action now.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"WEIGH_EVIDENCE\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"SRC-B\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Assign weights to remaining evidence based on authority and directness.\\\",\\\"state\\\":{}}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"TURN 6/8. ENVIRONMENT: A rare edge case is not covered by the primary evidence; test whether it changes the general conclusion. Choose the best next autonomous action now.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"EDGE_CASE\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"SRC-B\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Examine the rare edge case to determine its impact on the conclusion.\\\",\\\"state\\\":{}}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"TURN 7/8. ENVIRONMENT: The edge case is bounded. Synthesize the conclusion with limitations and provenance intact. Choose the best next autonomous action now.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"SYNTHESIZE\\\",\\\"checkpoint\\\":\\\"SRC-B\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Combine weighted evidence and edge‑case analysis into a final conclusion with provenance and limitations.\\\",\\\"state\\\":{}}\"},{\"role\":\"user\",\"co